{"page":248,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:104","surah":12,"ayah":104,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا تَسْـَٔلُهُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ أَجْرٍ ۚ إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرٌ لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You ask no reward from them for this: it is a reminder for all people","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَسْـَٔلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"you ask them","transliteration":"tasaluhum","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"for it","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَجْرٍ ۚ","en_gloss":"reward","transliteration":"ajrin","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"(is) it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ذِكْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a reminder","transliteration":"dhik'run","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"to the worlds","transliteration":"lil'ʿālamīna","verse_key":"12:104"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٠٤","en_gloss":"(104)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:104"}]},{"verse_key":"12:105","surah":12,"ayah":105,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَأَيِّن مِّنْ ءَايَةٍ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ يَمُرُّونَ عَلَيْهَا وَهُمْ عَنْهَا مُعْرِضُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and there are many signs in the heavens and the earth that they pass by and give no heed to-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَأَيِّن","en_gloss":"And how many","transliteration":"waka-ayyin","verse_key":"12:105"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:105"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَايَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a Sign","transliteration":"āyatin","verse_key":"12:105"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"12:105"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gl